      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Bike Transportation In Tadpatri</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The purpose of this handover document is to outline the process for ensuring a seamless delivery of two-wheelers and motorcycles from the sender's depot to the recipient's destination.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This handover process involves conducting a daylight condition re-inspection against the pickup photos, verifying the odometer against the LR bill of lading, and obtaining a signed condition sign-off from the recipient.</span></li></ul>

	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival at the recipient's depot, the delivery team will perform a thorough inspection of the two-wheeler or motorcycle to ensure it meets the condition as documented in the pickup photos.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The inspection will cover various aspects of the vehicle, including but not limited to:</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Any discrepancies or damages found during the re-inspection will be documented in the handover report.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To ensure accurate odometer readings are passed on to the recipient, the following steps will be followed:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>The delivery driver will compare the displayed odometer reading on the vehicle with the one recorded on the LR (Land Registry) bill of lading.</li>
		<li>If the odometer reading on the vehicle matches the recorded reading on the LR bill of lading, the driver will proceed with the handover.</li>
		<li>If there is a discrepancy between the two readings, the driver will request the recipient to verify the odometer reading using the vehicle's service history or maintenance records.</li>
		<li>Once the recipient confirms the accuracy of the odometer reading, the driver will update the LR bill of lading accordingly.</li>
	</ul>

	<p>To ensure a smooth delivery process, the recipient will be requested to sign off on the vehicle's condition upon receiving the two-wheeler or motorcycle.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



